# Data artefacts
# data/raw/ is the per-chunk API download cache: large, re-downloadable, and
# pure noise in a diff. The COMBINED history (data/conduit_history.parquet|csv)
# is deliberately NOT ignored - it is committed so the deployed app works
# offline, provided it stays under ~50 MB. If it grows past that, add it here.
data/raw/
data/cache/
# Ad-hoc API probe dumps from analysis/test_conduit_live.py - scratch output,
# regenerated on demand. The COMBINED history and the two evidence artefacts
# (backtest_ond2025.csv, rain_validation.csv) ARE committed so a judge can
# inspect the numbers without running anything.
data/conduit_probe_*.json
*.tmp
